<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Halvorsen 2027</a></li><li>Help out</li></ol><p class="kick">Pitch in</p><h1>Help out</h1><p class="lede">There is no sign-up form on this site, on purpose. Come to a Saturday canvass launch or call the office, and the field organizer will set you up.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><div class="three"><div class="box"><h3>Knock doors</h3><p style="margin:0">Saturday launches at ten, in a different precinct each week. New volunteers go out with someone experienced.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Drive voters</h3><p style="margin:0">Rides to early voting on the two Saturdays before the election. Drivers need a license and insurance on file with the office.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Host a porch coffee</h3><p style="margin:0">Ten neighbors and a pot of coffee. Noor comes for an hour and answers anything.</p></div></div><div class="card" style="max-width:780px"><p class="kick">Call or stop by</p><p style="margin:0">Campaign office, 12 Bandstand Square, Ashby Ford. Weekday evenings 5 to 8, Saturdays 9 to 3. (555) 016-2027 · office@halvorsen.example. This site does not take contributions or payments.</p></div></div></section>
